  "prefLabel": "Jus 602.07 Collateral financial source",
  "priorExpiration": "2017-09-25",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 602.07 “Collateral financial source” means a fiscal resource available to or on behalf of a victim and that can be used to defray in whole or in part an expense that is reimbursable under Jus 600.\n\nSource. #9553, eff 9-25-09, EXPIRED: 9-25-17\n\nNew. #12938, eff 12-9-19 (formerly Jus 602.06)",
